{"product_id":"the-beginners-photography-guide","title":"The beginner's photography guide.","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn contrast to the jargon-filled manuals that come with most digital cameras, The Beginner's Photography Guide presents step-by-step digital slr camera basics, while introducing and demonstrating a wide variety of techniques that will inspire the novice digital photographer. Grouped together by themes — color, composition, natural light, framing, and more — each camera technique is broken down into an easy-to-follow step-by-step sequence, and features annotated photographs and suggestions on getting the best from digital slr cameras and taking eye-catching photos.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Chris Gatcum\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781409322795\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 192\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 203 x 240\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41750681157785,"sku":"12RF9781409322795","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-beginners-photography-guide-871301.jpg?v=1694791653","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-beginners-photography-guide","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}